WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.048
In the year 954, the young Chai Rong ascended the throne as Emperor Shizong of Later Zhou.

00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:10.118
Young as he was, he was full of resolve and courage.

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:15.820
Northern Han and the Khitan formed an allied army, mighty in force, and attacked southward.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:22.602
At Gaoping the two sides drew up their formations, banners fluttering and war drums thundering.

00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:26.024
The soldiers stood in neat ranks, ready to meet the attack.

00:00:26.374 --> 00:00:32.494
Chai Rong took the field in person; the Later Zhou army fought ever more bravely, and the enemy began to retreat.

00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:36.492
Inspired, the soldiers charged bravely forward.

00:00:36.842 --> 00:00:43.322
Later Zhou won the Battle of Gaoping, and the banners of victory flew over the battlefield.

00:00:43.672 --> 00:00:51.496
Chai Rong seized the moment to reorganize the army, making Later Zhou stronger and laying the foundation for later unification.

00:00:51.846 --> 00:00:56.094
The strength of Later Zhou grew day by day.

